                                "sense_id": "072f2318-e727-34d2-b7aa-30548c725709",
                                "text": "Het boek wordt vaak geprezen als een literair meesterwerk",
                                "translation": "The book is often praised as a literary masterpiece.",
                                "english": "The book is often praised as a literary masterpiece."
                            },
                            {
